<description>
Remove or fix function declarations that don't match any definition.

Split out of #36743. Ideally we can have the compiler enforce/flag this in future.
</description>

<commits>
410843a684 rpc: make AddInputs static, remove mismatched declaration

The header declared AddInputs(..., bool rbf), which was never defined,
while the definition takes std::optional<bool> and has no declaration.

3fa42941d1 common: make FeeModeInfo static, remove mismatched declaration

0ae6589244 rpc: remove undefined RPCResult::ToStringObj and ToDescriptionString

These were declared in fa6b061fc1 but never defined or used.

bad11ff68e qt: remove undefined BanTableModel::{start,stop}AutoRefresh

The definitions were removed in 43c1f5b8d7, but the declarations were
left behind.

5f972485ff http: use MockableSteadyClock::time_point in ShouldDisconnect declaration

Match the definition, and the m_idle_since member.
</commits>

